Next we observe that the only way the left hand side can result into the right hand side is when $x$ is equal to the variable $n$. We insert that into the equation and find that -
\begin{align}
n^2 - 34n + 204 = n^2 \\
34n - 204 = 0 \\
n = \pm \frac{204}{34} \\
n = \pm\frac{102}{17} \\
\end{align}
